== Overview ==
The '''Turret Spider Toilet''' is an enemy that appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and the Event Mode. It looks almost exactly like the [[Spider Toilet]] but has a turret that can stun units and it also has a ton more health. It also has the same speed as Spider Toilet. 
